{"id":"1e949816ffa30842","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Groupwise Density Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number — ZFC CI Groupwise Density Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number — ZFC CI Groupwise Density Number","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-groupwise-density-number — ZFC CI Groupwise Density Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak g,\\mathcal G,s,\\mathscr H\\in V,\\ \\mathcal G\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega,\\ \\mathscr H\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathfrak g,\\mathcal G,s,\\mathscr H\\in V,\\ \\mathcal G\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega,\\ \\mathscr H\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCiGroupwiseDensityNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCiGroupwiseDensityNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}groupwise\\text{-}density\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal G\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\forall B\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(|B\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega\\to B\\in\\mathcal G\\bigr)\\land \\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(s,\\omega,\\omega)\\land s(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)&lt;s(n+1))\\bigr)\\to\\exists a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigcup_{n\\in a}[s(n),s(n+1))\\in\\mathcal G\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}groupwise\\text{-}density\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal G\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\forall B\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(|B\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega\\to B\\in\\mathcal G\\bigr)\\land \\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(s,\\omega,\\omega)\\land s(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)&lt;s(n+1))\\bigr)\\to\\exists a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigcup_{n\\in a}[s(n),s(n+1))\\in\\mathcal G\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}groupwise\\text{-}density\\text{-}number}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCiGroupwiseDensityNumber}_S(\\mathfrak g)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak g)\n\\land\\exists\\mathscr H\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathscr H|=\\mathfrak g\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr H\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\forall a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr H\\;(a\\notin\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\forall\\mathscr K\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\\;\n\\bigl(\n[\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr K\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\forall a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr K\\;(a\\notin\\mathcal G)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{74mm}\\to\\mathfrak g\\leq|\\mathscr K|\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}groupwise\\text{-}density\\text{-}number}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCiGroupwiseDensityNumber}_S(\\mathfrak g)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak g)\n\\land\\exists\\mathscr H\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathscr H|=\\mathfrak g\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr H\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\forall a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr H\\;(a\\notin\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\forall\\mathscr K\\subseteq\\mathcal P([\\omega]^\\omega)\\;\n\\bigl(\n[\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr K\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupwiseDense}_S(\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\forall a\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal G\\in\\mathscr K\\;(a\\notin\\mathcal G)]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{74mm}\\to\\mathfrak g\\leq|\\mathscr K|\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The invariant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak g\">\\(\\mathfrak g\\)</span> counts how many groupwise-dense subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> are needed before their intersection can be empty.</li>\n<li>Its minimality is internalized by the final lower-bound clause instead of an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved"